OL,3,GNEWSAKeeping mortgage interest relief
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA move to keep tax relief on interest
OL,7,Fpaid on mortgage payments has been
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FDeputy Aidan Matthews, who brought the
OL,11,Famendment to the Budget in Guernsey,
OL,12,Fsaid it was currently the "worst
OL,13,Fpossible time" to consider phasing out
OL,14,Fthe tax relief. It also meant that the
OL,15,Fphased withdrawal of the relief, which
OL,16,Fwas agreed in 2015, would also stop, it
OL,17,Fwas confirmed.
OL,19,FThe relief allows homeowners to apply
OL,20,Ffor tax relief on any interest paid on
OL,21,Fthe mortgage of their principle
OL,22,Fresidence of up to #3,500 a year.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
