OL,3,GNEWSAKeeping mortgage interest relief
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking against the move, Deputy Neil
OL,7,FInder said that, while the idea was
OL,8,Fright in isolation, if all amendments
OL,9,Fwere approved, it would add "#20m to
OL,10,Fthe budget".
